{"seq":41,"slug":"mixture-density-networks","title":"混合密度网络","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"混合密度网络-让神经网络吐出一整条分布\">混合密度网络：让神经网络吐出一整条分布</h1><p>一个标准的回归网络对每个输入只给一个数字。可现实里同一个输入常常对应好几个同样合理的答案：机械臂末端要到某个坐标，肘关节可以朝上也可以朝下；行人站在路口，下一秒可能左转、右转或直行。把这些答案用最小二乘一平均，得到的往往是一个谁也不满意的&quot;中间值&quot;——手臂僵在半空，车预测行人径直撞上花坛。混合密度网络（Mixture Density Network，MDN）由 Christopher Bishop 在 1994 年提出，正是为治这个病：它让网络不再输出一个点，而是输出一整个条件概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，通常是若干高斯分量的加权叠加。哪里该有几个峰、每个峰在哪、有多宽，全部由网络自己根据输入学出来。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把 MDN 拆成四条递进的主线，顺着&quot;为什么—长什么样—怎么训—怎么用&quot;走完一遍。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条线·基础</strong>回答动机与形态。<a href=\"foundations/why-mdn\">为何混合密度网络</a> 讲清点估计在何处失效、MDN 用分布替代点估计的核心思想；<a href=\"foundations/multimodal-regression\">多峰回归之痛</a> 深挖一对多映射与逆问题这个病根；<a href=\"foundations/mdn-model\">MDN 模型结构</a> 给出完整的条件密度公式与前向计算图。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条线·参数化</strong>拆开网络的输出头。一个混合分布由三组量决定：<a href=\"parameterization/mixing-coefficients\">混合系数</a> 用 softmax 保证权重非负且和为一；<a href=\"parameterization/component-params\">分量参数化</a> 管每个高斯的均值与协方差；<a href=\"parameterization/output-constraints\">输出约束与激活</a> 用激活函数强制方差为正、参数落在合法区间。</p>\n<p><strong>第三条线·训练</strong>是 MDN 最容易翻车的地方。<a href=\"training/nll-loss\">负对数似然损失</a> 给出该用什么目标函数；<a href=\"training/numerical-stability\">数值稳定</a> 讲 log-sum-exp 如何避免下溢与 NaN；<a href=\"training/mode-collapse\">分量坍缩与初始化</a> 处理方差塌到零、分量退化这些顽疾。</p>\n<p><strong>第四条线·实践</strong>把模型接回现实。<a href=\"practice/sampling-inference\">采样与推断</a> 讲训练完怎么取用一个分布；<a href=\"practice/mdn-applications\">应用</a> 罗列逆运动学、轨迹预测、语音与控制等真实场景；<a href=\"practice/mdn-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 谈选几个分量、怎么评估，以及何时该换成归一化流或扩散模型。</p>\n<p>**本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界。**本 hub 只讲&quot;用神经网络参数化一个混合分布并端到端训练&quot;这一件事。它与几个近邻各有清晰分界：<a href=\"../gaussian-processes/regression/gp-regression\">高斯过程</a> 同样给条件分布，但走非参数贝叶斯路线且默认单峰；<a href=\"../quantile-regression-methods/foundations/pinball-loss\">分位数回归</a> 不假设分布形状、直接估分位点，本 hub 假设混合高斯形状；<a href=\"../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/foundations/why-conformal-prediction\">共形预测</a> 给的是有覆盖保证的区间，是 MDN 输出之上的一层校准；<a href=\"../bayesian-data-analysis/computation/variational-inference\">贝叶斯推断中的变分方法</a> 与 MDN 的 EM 式训练共享混合模型的数学根基。凡这些邻居主讲的内容，本 hub 只一句点到并链接过去，不重复展开。</p>\n<p>**推荐学习路径。**只想知道 MDN 是什么、能干什么的读者，读完基础三篇加 <a href=\"practice/mdn-applications\">应用</a> 即可。要动手实现的工程师，重点在参数化与训练两章——尤其 <a href=\"training/numerical-stability\">数值稳定</a> 与 <a href=\"training/mode-collapse\">分量坍缩与初始化</a>，MDN 的坑几乎全在这里。做研究选型的读者，直奔 <a href=\"practice/mdn-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 看它与归一化流、扩散模型的取舍。</p>\n<p>**前置知识。**读者应熟悉前馈神经网络与反向传播、最大似然估计、多元高斯分布，以及基本的 softmax 与交叉熵。不需要提前懂高斯混合模型的 EM 算法，本 hub 会在需要处补足。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：从点估计的失败到分布输出","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-mdn","title":"为何混合密度网络：当一个答案不够用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/why-mdn"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-regression","title":"多峰回归之痛：一对多映射从哪里来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/multimodal-regression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mdn-model","title":"MDN 模型结构：一个网络，一整个分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/mdn-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"parameterization","title":"参数化：把输出头拆成三组量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/parameterization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mixing-coefficients","title":"混合系数：为什么非 softmax 不可","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/parameterization/mixing-coefficients"},{"seq":2,"slug":"component-params","title":"分量参数化：均值好办，协方差要命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/parameterization/component-params"},{"seq":3,"slug":"output-constraints","title":"输出约束与激活：把方差压进正数区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/parameterization/output-constraints"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"training","title":"训练：MDN 最容易翻车的地方","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/training","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nll-loss","title":"负对数似然损失：把密度变成可优化目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/training/nll-loss"},{"seq":2,"slug":"numerical-stability","title":"数值稳定：log-sum-exp 与一套保命配方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/training/numerical-stability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mode-collapse","title":"分量坍缩与初始化：治 MDN 的两种慢性病","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/training/mode-collapse"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践：把分布接回现实","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sampling-inference","title":"采样与推断：从一个分布里取出可用的答案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/sampling-inference"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mdn-applications","title":"应用：从逆运动学到轨迹预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/mdn-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mdn-in-practice","title":"落地与边界：选几个分量，什么时候别用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/mdn-in-practice"}]}]}